      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "[quote=\"Ameena\"]\n\nHmm, wait, so for question four, can Coastal lands be built in, or not? I&#39;ve always treated them like they count for this effect and had Invaders not Build in any of them, even if they include a land type that <em>is</em> included (eg if I currently have Sand and Coastal showing in my Invader card line-up, I&#39;ll skip any Wetlands, Mountains, and Jungles that are on the coast because they&#39;re covered by the &quot;Coastal&quot; land card). Was that wrong, then? Oops...\n\n[/quote]\n\nCoastal is not a terrain, so it doesn&#39;t stop them from building in any lands. So if you have Sands and Coastal Lands showing, and you choose to build in Wetlands, you build in all Wetlands, including Coastal Wetlands.\n",
