      "raw": "<p>Oops, I&#39;ve been doing that Event wrong this whole time, then - is the &quot;Coastal Lands don&#39;t count&quot; thing mentioned in the rulebook somewhere? I feel like I would&#39;ve noticed it at some point if it was...</p>",
