      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "FYI: Per the Glossary from the rulebook:&nbsp;\n\n[quote=\"Spirit Island rulebook\"]\n\nLand Type: A description of what sort of land to act upon. This may be a terrain, Coastal/Inland, or a requirement for what&rsquo;s in/not in the land (e.g. &ldquo;A land with Invaders&rdquo;). [p. 13, 16]\n\n...\n\nTerrain: Jungle, Mountain, Sands, or Wetland. Each land has one terrain. [p. 13]\n[/quote]\n\nSo &quot;Coastal&quot; is a <em>Land Type</em>, but not a <em>Terrain Type</em>, whereas &quot;Jungle&quot; is both.\n\nThat&#39;s my take, anyway.&nbsp; :wink: ",
